#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:1 1123e4ec19494a55b24140d89404d81e
msgid "optuna_search.py 命令行参考"
msgstr "optuna_search.py Command Line Reference"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:3 c8c61976c5434bb78e2a23fbd3872a33
msgid ""
"`optuna_search.py` 基于 [Optuna](https://optuna.org/) "
"提供了高度自动化、即插即用的超参数寻优系统。UniKT 从模型的 `ModelConfig` "
"中自动推断搜索空间，支持单目标优化、多目标联合优化与断点恢复。"
msgstr ""
"`optuna_search.py` provides a highly automated, plug-and-play "
"hyperparameter optimization system based on "
"[Optuna](https://optuna.org/). UniKT automatically infers the search "
"space from the model's `ModelConfig`, supporting single-objective "
"optimization, multi-objective joint optimization, and checkpoint "
"resuming."

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:5 e202294afc7d4ee7b6247b3a3009075f
msgid "基本语法"
msgstr "Basic Syntax"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:7 4bc540d1b9a646da80ff194afa1472f9
msgid "python optuna_search.py -m <ModelName> -d <DatasetName> [OPTIONS]\n"
msgstr "python optuna_search.py -m <ModelName> -d <DatasetName> [OPTIONS]\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:13 181f87db17194f368b21f3fd58bb79c9
