#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:27 462920c1e33046eaa918de27902943d7
msgid "搜索空间自动推断机制"
msgstr "Automatic Search Space Inference Mechanism"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:29 19d03ed5261549feb1589f619e8fa085
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"UniKT 无需手写冗长的 Optuna 建议代码。在编写模型的 `ModelConfig` 时，通过字段元数据声明 "
"`metadata={\"optuna\": {...}}`，系统便会自动解析为 Optuna 搜索空间："
msgstr ""
"UniKT eliminates the need to hand-write verbose Optuna suggestion code. "
"When writing a model's `ModelConfig`, simply declare field metadata "
"`metadata={\"optuna\": {...}}`, and the system automatically parses it "
"into an Optuna search space:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:31 de62e28772b74e7ab2343675f3f27a75
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"@register_model_config(\"GIKT\")\n"
"class GIKTConfig(ModelConfig):\n"
"    # 整数范围采样\n"
"    n_hop: int = field(\n"
"        default=3,\n"
"        metadata={\"optuna\": {\"type\": \"int\", \"low\": 1, \"high\": "
"5}},\n"
"    )\n"
"    # 对数尺度浮点采样\n"
"    learning_rate: float = field(\n"
"        default=1e-3,\n"
"        metadata={\"optuna\": {\"type\": \"float\", \"low\": 1e-4, "
"\"high\": 1e-2, \"log\": True}},\n"
"    )\n"
"    # 离散类别采样\n"
"    batch_size: int = field(\n"
"        default=128,\n"
"        metadata={\"optuna\": {\"type\": \"categorical\", \"choices\": "
"[64, 128, 256]}},\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"@register_model_config(\"GIKT\")\n"
"class GIKTConfig(ModelConfig):\n"
"    # Integer range sampling\n"
"    n_hop: int = field(\n"
"        default=3,\n"
"        metadata={\"optuna\": {\"type\": \"int\", \"low\": 1, \"high\": "
"5}},\n"
"    )\n"
"    # Log-scale float sampling\n"
"    learning_rate: float = field(\n"
"        default=1e-3,\n"
"        metadata={\"optuna\": {\"type\": \"float\", \"low\": 1e-4, "
"\"high\": 1e-2, \"log\": True}},\n"
"    )\n"
"    # Categorical sampling\n"
"    batch_size: int = field(\n"
"        default=128,\n"
"        metadata={\"optuna\": {\"type\": \"categorical\", \"choices\": "
"[64, 128, 256]}},\n"
"    )\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:51 d975adbf69da44d38a3a34e609108b36
msgid "支持的 `type` 包括："
msgstr "Supported `type` values include:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:52 e5360cbd19824d918dd5f9c39428910a
msgid "`int`：支持 `low`, `high`, `step`, `log`"
msgstr "`int`: Supports `low`, `high`, `step`, `log`"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:53 12a185e6eb9b4f31b7867805c5bc3c50
msgid "`float`：支持 `low`, `high`, `step`, `log`"
msgstr "`float`: Supports `low`, `high`, `step`, `log`"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:54 9aebadb2a1b740cc975670f922463d4b
msgid "`categorical`：支持 `choices` 列表"
msgstr "`categorical`: Supports `choices` list"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:58 89451e63bb6d4909b611e864e312180c
msgid "常用命令示例"
msgstr "Common Command Examples"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:60 33c36994e32a4c5a85b0ad1aa4486f5d
msgid "1. 基础单目标搜索"
msgstr "1\\. Basic Single-Objective Search"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:61 e580b7e275654b2b8308f83396efa45e
msgid "python optuna_search.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --data.fold 0\n"
msgstr "python optuna_search.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --data.fold 0\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:65 38ec6f6fcf24439aaf2a8c8d22e461e6
msgid "2. 多目标联合优化"
msgstr "2\\. Multi-Objective Joint Optimization"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:66 25028f6b4d8540c08cda4e319165f429
msgid ""
"同时最大化 `auc` 并最小化 `rmse`（多目标时建议在 `optuna_config.yaml` 中配置 `sampler: "
"nsgaii`）："
msgstr ""
"Simultaneously maximize `auc` and minimize `rmse` (for multi-objective "
"search, setting `sampler: nsgaii` in `optuna_config.yaml` is "
"recommended):"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:67 da95122cf6c24d0ab3bfe84e73761d53
msgid ""
"python optuna_search.py -m AKT -d assistments09 --optuna_search.metric "
"auc,rmse\n"
msgstr ""
"python optuna_search.py -m AKT -d assistments09 --optuna_search.metric "
"auc,rmse\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:71 7bbb822af82f4e4eaf0f424d4c1c919f
msgid "3. 从中断的搜索中恢复"
msgstr "3\\. Resume from Interrupted Search"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:72 8e426ed7d145488fa72cc6ec239244ad
msgid ""
"python optuna_search.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"    --optuna_search.resume "
"runs/hyperparam_search/GIKT_assist09_20260520_n_trials50\n"
msgstr ""
"python optuna_search.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"    --optuna_search.resume "
"runs/hyperparam_search/GIKT_assist09_20260520_n_trials50\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:77 a25acf2767ea4b31bc9fef70cac3d382
msgid "4. 覆盖单次 Trial 的训练轮数"
msgstr "4\\. Override Training Epochs per Trial"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:78 9de9d8b612c94231b2242407789e1cc1
msgid "可以在命令行中直接覆盖训练参数，加快搜索速度："
msgstr ""
"You can directly override training parameters on the command line to "
"accelerate search speed:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:79 e4c107c644c94b54a59d29d8e315ee55
msgid ""
"python optuna_search.py -m DKT -d assistments09 --model.epochs 30 "
"--early_stopping.patience 5\n"
msgstr ""
"python optuna_search.py -m DKT -d assistments09 --model.epochs 30 "
"--early_stopping.patience 5\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:85 1052fada84374a5fb22cef9a81d9abb4
msgid "产出物与最佳参数复现"
msgstr "Artifacts and Best Parameter Reproduction"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:87 97c0960870674e299f460cd3c00eca9b
msgid "搜索完成后，实验目录下将生成以下核心工件："
msgstr ""
"After search completes, the following core artifacts are generated in the"
" experiment directory:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:89 b4eb0d6061204cb89addeb9cd837019d
msgid ""
"runs/hyperparam_search/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_n_trials100/\n"
"├── study.db                        # SQLite 数据库，保存所有 Trial 的参数与评估历史\n"
"├── best_run_config.yaml            # 自动生成的最佳超参数完整复现配置文件\n"
"├── best_params.yaml                # 最佳超参数扁平键值对\n"
"├── trials_history_gikt.csv         # 包含所有 Trial 的超参数与指标表格\n"
"├── optuna_config.yaml              # 本次搜索使用的超参数空间配置\n"
"├── param_importances.yaml          # 各超参数对目标指标的重要度评估\n"
"├── search_history.yaml             # 试验迭代历史轨迹\n"
"└── run.log                         # 搜索控制台日志\n"
msgstr ""
"runs/hyperparam_search/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_n_trials100/\n"
"├── study.db                        # SQLite database storing parameters "
"and evaluation history for all trials\n"
"├── best_run_config.yaml            # Automatically generated full "
"configuration file for reproducing best hyperparameters\n"
"├── best_params.yaml                # Flat key-value pairs of best "
"hyperparameters\n"
"├── trials_history_gikt.csv         # Table of hyperparameters and "
"metrics across all trials\n"
"├── optuna_config.yaml              # Hyperparameter search space "
"configuration used for this run\n"
"├── param_importances.yaml          # Evaluated importance of each "
"hyperparameter on target metrics\n"
"├── search_history.yaml             # Trial iteration historical "
"trajectory\n"
"└── run.log                         # Search console log\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:101 0c700cb2d1ff4844962ecdc78a6b3f21
msgid "一键复现最佳超参数模型"
msgstr "One-Click Reproduction of Best Hyperparameter Model"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:103 db82d15b85a242a48e40d90dbd0f25bf
msgid ""
"搜索程序会自动去除搜索时的性能压制项（自动恢复 SwanLab 跟踪、检查点保存与测试集评估），生成标准干净的 "
"`best_run_config.yaml`。只需一行命令即可使用最佳超参训练正式模型："
msgstr ""
"The search process automatically strips search-time performance "
"suppressions (restoring SwanLab tracking, checkpoint saving, and test set"
" evaluation) to produce a clean, standard `best_run_config.yaml`. Train "
"the production model with best hyperparameters in a single command:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/optuna.md:105 ba8f16cc8ded4b05a7fef74e7d60e3e8
msgid ""
"python train.py --config "
"runs/hyperparam_search/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_n_trials100/best_run_config.yaml"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"python train.py --config "
"runs/hyperparam_search/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_n_trials100/best_run_config.yaml"
"\n"
